{{!--
  UiCalendar → the element from CalendarPainter.java, the server-side twin of
  renderCalendar() in calendar/extension.ts, in two halves: the painter draws
  up to the header's slot, this template renders the page's extras there with
  the core's `render` helper, and the painter closes. The painter, not the
  template, does the drawing, so the two stay one function apart.
--}}
{{{calendarOpen this}}}{{#if extras}}<div class="sui-calendar-extras">{{#each extras}}{{{render this}}}{{/each}}</div>{{/if}}{{{calendarRest this}}}
